  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "PlayAd and PlayMediatedAd now report every failure to OnAdPlayFailure, not only in the returned play info. AdPlayEventArgs.EventID is now set on OnAdEnd, OnAdPlayRewarded and OnAdPlayClick as well as OnAdStart. A new play on a placement that already has an ad on screen ends that ad first (one OnAdEnd per play); ads on different placements can play side by side. The creative is told the real ad-surface size, and a warning is logged when a play starts on a surface shorter than the recommended 250 device-independent pixels (the ad still plays). device.w / device.h now report the window's client area in physical pixels. An exception thrown by your initialization success handler is logged and no longer reported as an initialization failure. A failed creative download now completes LoadAd with a failure instead of never calling back, and a server Retry-After can no longer cause unbounded retries. Header-bidding creative folders are now cleaned up.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "Vungle SDK for Windows Desktop Native C++ (x64)",
